WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:03.169
- GO FOR IT, MAN.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.437
- OKAY, GOOD.
GOOD, GOOD, GOOD.

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:05.838
OH, THAT'S NUTS, MAN.

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:07.307
- OKAY, WE GOT TO HURRY UP.
BRING ON THE WEED.

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:08.908
- OKAY, JUST GOT TO--
- BREAK IT OUT THERE.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.111
- HEY.
- OH!

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:14.280
- SORRY.
SORRY.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.850
- YOU ALL WANT TO DO
SOME OF THAT GOD DRUG?

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:20.853
[violin screeching eerily]

00:00:20.853 --> 00:00:23.823
♪ ♪

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:24.824
- NO.

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:25.858
- WHAT THE [bleep]?

00:00:25.858 --> 00:00:26.959
- WHO'S THIS GUY?

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:29.595
- YOU ALL EVER HEARD
OF THE GOD DRUG?

00:00:29.595 --> 00:00:32.565
- I'VE--I'VE NEVER
HEARD OF THAT.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:36.168
- AKA SLAYER, CUTTY-CUTTY,

00:00:36.168 --> 00:00:41.740
DOUBLE CUTTY, ELMO, CAT VAG.

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:42.742
- OKAY.

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:45.378
- LONG ISLAND BRAIN SLICE,

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:47.080
FUNT.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.381
- FUNT?
- FUNT.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.016
- FUNT, I'VE HEARD OF THAT.

00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:54.354
- IT TAKES ALL YOUR GREATEST
FEARS AND INSECURITIES,

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:57.957
AND IT GIVES THEM
TEETH AND ARMS,

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:00.659
AND THEN IT LOCKS YOU
IN A ROOM WITH THEM

00:01:00.659 --> 00:01:03.763
FROM WHICH YOU CANNOT ESCAPE.

00:01:06.532 --> 00:01:08.167
- OH, THAT SOUNDS TERRIBLE.

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:10.536
- YEAH, I DON'T WANT THAT, MAN.
- NONE OF THOSE WORDS ARE GOOD.

00:01:10.536 --> 00:01:13.773
- YOU REALIZE THE FACE OF GOD

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:17.110
IS SOMEWHERE INSIDE YOUR BODY,

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:22.081
BUT YOU CAN'T FIND IT,
AND IT HATES YOU.

00:01:22.081 --> 00:01:24.818
- UM, OKAY, NONE OF US ARE
INTERESTED IN THIS DRUG.

00:01:24.818 --> 00:01:26.151
THANK YOU, SIR.
NICE MEETING YOU.

00:01:26.151 --> 00:01:28.387
- LET'S HEAR HIM OUT.
LET'S HEAR HIM OUT.

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:33.092
- IT'S A RAZOR SHARP CRYSTAL
YOU TUCK UNDER YOUR EYELID.

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:34.660
- OOH.
- UGH.

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:38.531
- AND THEN WHEN YOUR OCULAR
CAVITY STARTS BLEEDING,

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:41.266
IT GOES DIRECTLY
INTO YOUR BRAIN.

00:01:41.266 --> 00:01:43.368
- I FEEL LIKE
THERE'S GOT TO BE A GOOD PART.

00:01:43.368 --> 00:01:45.104
- YEAH, YOU'VE JUST DESCRIBED

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:48.975
A LIFE-WRECKING
PHYSICAL ADDICTION.

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:50.977
- IF YOU'D LET HIM FINISH--
IF YOU'D LET HIM FINISH,

00:01:50.977 --> 00:01:53.412
HE'S GONNA GET TO
THE EUPHORIA, I'M SURE.

00:01:53.412 --> 00:01:57.016
- JUST WHEN YOU CAN'T TAKE
ANY MORE,

00:01:57.016 --> 00:01:58.051
[inhales sharply]

00:01:58.051 --> 00:01:59.685
YOU POOP YOUR MOUTH.

00:01:59.685 --> 00:02:01.354
- I'M SORRY, WHAT?
- YOU POOP IN YOUR MOUTH?

00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:03.255
- NO,

00:02:03.255 --> 00:02:04.923
YOU POOP OUT OF YOUR MOUTH.

00:02:04.923 --> 00:02:07.126
- I'M IN.

00:02:07.126 --> 00:02:08.894
GUYS, IF PEOPLE WILL
REALLY GO THROUGH THIS,

00:02:08.894 --> 00:02:10.363
THE HIGH MUST BE AMAZING.

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:11.964
- BUDDY,
REMEMBER WHEN YOU DID MUSHROOMS

00:02:11.964 --> 00:02:13.132
AND YOU CRIED FOR THREE HOURS?

00:02:13.132 --> 00:02:14.367
THIS IS WORSE THAN THAT.
- YEAH.

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:16.168
- OH, THE EYES.

00:02:16.168 --> 00:02:18.137
OH, OH!

00:02:18.137 --> 00:02:19.304
[yelling]

00:02:19.304 --> 00:02:21.941
OH, GOD!

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:23.041
[both groaning]
- IT HURTS!

00:02:23.041 --> 00:02:25.711
- OH, JEB.
- OH, THAT HURTS!

00:02:25.711 --> 00:02:27.814
WHEN DOES IT START WORKING?

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:29.549
- HOW SHOULD I KNOW?

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:31.651
I DON'T DO DRUGS.

00:02:32.718 --> 00:02:34.420
DRUGS ARE FOR LOSERS.

